# Authority migration
# caption: What it settles. How a system of record moves, whether it is Five9 to Flex or ServiceTitan to a native scheduler. Canonical IDs survive the switch; going back afterwards is a new controlled migration, not a rollback.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ExternalAuthority
    ExternalAuthority --> ShadowNative: Reconcile and compare
    ShadowNative --> Drain: Certify selected boundary
    Drain --> ExternalAuthority: Abort before authority switch
    Drain --> NativeAuthority: Fence old writer and change epoch
    NativeAuthority --> Reconciliation: Observe side effects
    Reconciliation --> NativeAuthority: Consistent
    Reconciliation --> RecoveryDecision: Drift or unknown command
    RecoveryDecision --> NativeAuthority: Repair under current authority
  